      "biography": {
        "type": "String",
        "label": "Biography",
        "value": "<p>The Aachdenie is a small riding horse originally bred in central Ostland near Aachden. It's noted for its comfortable gait, placid and inquisitive nature, and patience, making it a popular breed for those seeking to teach the young to ride. Normally with fleabitten or dapple-grey coats, Aachdenies can be found at horse markets throughout the Empire, but are most common in the north-east. They are usually no taller than 12 hands.</p>\n<p><strong>Commonly Owned By:</strong>&nbsp;Herbalist, Hunter, Miner, Outlaw</p>"
      },
